{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/c7ixgjqx","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":862,"top":596,"width":480,"height":403},"text":"The system reads photographed handwriting and identifies the writer. It uses stored glyph shapes to reproduce new text in a selected style with a pen gantry. The system supports 11 writer styles.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#17212B","alignment":"left"}}
